{"verse_key": "10:2", "surah": 10, "verse": 2, "text_uthmani": "أَكَانَ لِلنَّاسِ عَجَبًا أَنْ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ رَجُلٍ مِّنْهُمْ أَنْ أَنذِرِ ٱلنَّاسَ وَبَشِّرِ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ أَنَّ لَهُمْ قَدَمَ صِدْقٍ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ ۗ قَالَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَسَـٰحِرٌ مُّبِينٌ", "translation": "Have the people been amazed that We revealed [revelation] to a man from among them, [saying], \"Warn mankind and give good tidings to those who believe that they will have a [firm] precedence of honor<sup foot_note=196432>1</sup> with their Lord\"? [But] the disbelievers say, \"Indeed, this is an obvious magician.\"", "verse_from_ms": 11230, "verse_to_ms": 40460, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "أَكَانَ", "start_ms": 11230, "end_ms": 12140}, {"i": 1, "text": "لِلنَّاسِ", "start_ms": 12140, "end_ms": 13490}, {"i": 2, "text": "عَجَبًا", "start_ms": 13490, "end_ms": 14280}, {"i": 3, "text": "أَنْ", "start_ms": 14280, "end_ms": 14680}, {"i": 4, "text": "أَوْحَيْنَآ", "start_ms": 14680, "end_ms": 17170}, {"i": 5, "text": "إِلَىٰ", "start_ms": 17170, "end_ms": 17760}, {"i": 6, "text": "رَجُلٍ", "start_ms": 17760, "end_ms": 18560}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِّنْهُمْ", "start_ms": 18560, "end_ms": 19730}, {"i": 8, "text": "أَنْ", "start_ms": 19730, "end_ms": 20070}, {"i": 9, "text": "أَنذِرِ", "start_ms": 20070, "end_ms": 21260}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "start_ms": 21260, "end_ms": 22400}, {"i": 11, "text": "وَبَشِّرِ", "start_ms": 22400, "end_ms": 23220}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 23220, "end_ms": 24290}, {"i": 13, "text": "ءَامَنُوٓا۟", "start_ms": 24290, "end_ms": 26370}, {"i": 14, "text": "أَنَّ", "start_ms": 26370, "end_ms": 27360}, {"i": 15, "text": "لَهُمْ", "start_ms": 27360, "end_ms": 27960}, {"i": 16, "text": "قَدَمَ", "start_ms": 27960, "end_ms": 28430}, {"i": 17, "text": "صِدْقٍ", "start_ms": 28430, "end_ms": 29280}, {"i": 18, "text": "عِندَ", "start_ms": 29280, "end_